tion_note":"以此來源所述兩端為據。","status":"source_attested","reviewer":"Codex（AI 代理）","human_reviewed":false,"model":null}],"title_holdings":[],"address_assertions":[],"table_occurrences":[],"date_normalizations":[],"birth_order_constraints":[],"preferred_birth_order_constraints":[],"identity_decisions":[],"equivalence_decisions":[],"passages":[{"id":"c-jinshu-067-xijian:line078","text":"及鳳等平，溫嶠上議，請宥敦佐吏，鑒以為先王崇君臣之教，故貴伏死之節；昏亡之主，故開待放之門。王敦佐吏雖多逼迫，然居逆亂之朝，無出關之操，準之前訓，宜加義責。又奏錢鳳母年八十，宜蒙全宥。乃從之。封高平侯，賜絹四千八百匹。帝以其有器望，萬機動靜輒問之，乃詔鑒特草上表疏，以從簡易。王導議欲贈周札官，鑒以為不合，語在札傳。導不從。鑒於是駮之曰：「敦之逆謀，履霜日久，緣札開門，令王師不振。若敦前者之舉，義同桓文，則先帝可為幽厲邪？」朝臣雖無以難，而不能從。俄而遷車騎將軍、都督徐兗青三州軍事、兗州刺史、假節，鎮廣陵。尋而帝崩，鑒與王導、卞壼、溫嶠、庾亮、陸曄等並受遺詔，輔少主，進位車騎大將軍、開府儀同三司，加散騎常侍。","text_layer":"received_chapter","annotation_status":"reviewed","mentions":[{"id":"c-jinshu-067-xijian:line078:m0001","start":1,"end":2,"surface":"鳳","kind":"person","person_id":"762_5c8_663","status":"contextual_provisional","interpretation_note":"以來源原字標記。"},{"id":"c-jinshu-067-xijian:line078:m0005","start":5,"end":7,"surface":"溫嶠","kind":"person","person_id":"6v8_pk9_7k5","status":"contextual_provisional","interpretation_note":"以來源原字標記。"},{"id":"c-jinshu-067-xijian:line078:m0012","start":12,"end":13,"surface":"敦","kind":"person","person_id":"39o_b6y_n74","status":"contextual_provisional","interpretation_note":"以來源原字標記。"},{"id":"c-jinshu-067-xijian:line078:m0016","start":16,"end":17,"surface":"鑒","kind":"person","person_id":"6lr_zci_i0j","status":"contextual_provisional","interpretation_note":"以來源原字標記。"},{"id":"c-jinshu-067-xijian:line078:m0046","start":46,"end":48,"surface":"王敦","kind":"person","person_id":"39o_b6y_n74","status":"contextual_provisional","interpretation_note":"以來源原字標記。"},{"id":"c-jinshu-067-xijian:line078:m0080","start":80,"end":83,"surface":"錢鳳母","kind":"person","person_id":"z6p_bdf_yhl","status":"contextual_provisional","interpretation_note":"以來源原字標記。"},{"id":"c-jinshu-067-xijian:line078:m0126","start":126,"end":127,"surface":"鑒","kind":"person","person_id":"6lr_zci_i0