ne078:m0201","start":201,"end":202,"surface":"文","kind":"person","person_id":"6di_ywz_ju4_AAA","status":"contextual_provisional","interpretation_note":"讀本段前後及對話，所指按此處記。"},{"id":"c-jinshu-067-xijian:line078:m0208","start":208,"end":209,"surface":"幽","kind":"person","person_id":"fd5_uxa_0c9","status":"contextual_provisional","interpretation_note":"讀本段前後及對話，所指按此處記。"},{"id":"c-jinshu-067-xijian:line078:m0209","start":209,"end":210,"surface":"厲","kind":"person","person_id":"jps_m3k_hu4","status":"contextual_provisional","interpretation_note":"讀本段前後及對話，所指按此處記。"},{"id":"c-jinshu-067-xijian:line078:m0260","start":260,"end":261,"surface":"鑒","kind":"person","person_id":"6lr_zci_i0j","status":"contextual_provisional","interpretation_note":"以來源原字標記。"},{"id":"c-jinshu-067-xijian:line078:m0262","start":262,"end":264,"surface":"王導","kind":"person","person_id":"7r6_k52_qji_ABAA","status":"contextual_provisional","interpretation_note":"以來源原字標記。"},{"id":"c-jinshu-067-xijian:line078:m0265","start":265,"end":267,"surface":"卞壼","kind":"person","person_id":"4z4_ujq_8yo","status":"contextual_provisional","interpretation_note":"以來源原字標記。"},{"id":"c-jinshu-067-xijian:line078:m0268","start":268,"end":270,"surface":"溫嶠","kind":"person","person_id":"6v8_pk9_7k5","status":"contextual_provisional","interpretation_note":"以來源原字標記。"},{"id":"c-jinshu-067-xijian:line078:m0271","start":271,"end":273,"surface":"庾亮","kind":"person","person_id":"4qr_wrk_3vd_B","status":"contextual_provisional","interpretation_note":"以來源原字標記。"},{"id":"c-jinshu-067-xijian:line078:m0274","start":274,"end":276,"surface":"陸曄","kind":"person","person_id":"h07_7e5_0jk","status":"contextual_provisional","interpretation_note":"以來源原字標記。"}],"source_position":{"first_line":78,"last_line":78,"revision_id":2592755},"source_quote":{"witness":"j67","quote":"及鳳等平，溫嶠上議，請宥敦佐吏，鑒以為先王崇君臣之教，故貴伏死之節；昏亡之主，故開待放之門。王敦佐吏雖多逼迫，然居逆亂之朝，無出關之操，準之前訓，宜加義責。又奏錢鳳母年八十，宜蒙全宥。乃從之。封高平侯，賜絹四千八百匹。帝以其有器望，萬機動靜輒問之，乃詔鑒特草上表疏，以從簡易。王導議欲贈周札官，鑒以為不合，語在札傳。導不從。鑒於是駮之曰：「敦之逆謀，履霜日久，緣札開門，令王師不振。若敦前者之舉，義同桓文，則先帝可為幽厲邪？」朝臣雖無以難，而不能從。俄而遷車騎將軍、都督徐兗青三州軍事、兗州刺史、假節，鎮廣陵。尋而帝崩，鑒與王導、卞壼、溫嶠、庾亮、陸曄等並受遺詔，輔少主，進位車騎大將軍、開府儀同三司，加散騎常侍。","raw_start":7598,"raw_end":7905,"raw_line":78},"chapter_id":"c-jinshu-067-xijian","book_id":"b-jinshu-067","work_id":"w-jinshu","source_id":"s-jinshu-067-xijian"},{"id":"c-jinshu-098-jin033-wangji:line045","text":"敦至石頭，欲攻劉隗，其將杜弘曰：「劉隗死士眾多，未易可克，不如攻石頭。周劄少恩，兵不為用，攻之必敗。劄敗，則隗自走。」敦從之。劄果開城門納弘。諸將與敦戰，王師敗績。既入石頭，擁兵不朝，放肆兵士劫掠內外。官省奔散，惟有侍中二人侍帝。帝脫戎衣，著朝服，顧而言曰：「欲得我處，但當早道，我自還琅邪，何至困百姓如此！」敦收周顗、戴若思害之。以敦為丞相、江州牧，進爵武昌郡公，邑萬戶，使太常荀崧就拜，又加羽葆鼓吹，並偽讓不受。還屯武昌，多害忠良，寵樹親戚，以兄含為衛將軍、都督沔南軍事、領南蠻校尉、荊州刺史，以義陽太守任愔督河北諸軍事、南中郎將，敦又自督寧、益二州。","annotation_status":"reviewed","text_layer":"received_chapter","mentions":[{"id":"c-jinshu-098-jin033-wangji:line045:m0000","start":0,"end":1,"surface":"敦","kind":"person","person_id":"39o_b6y_n74","status":"contextual_provisional","interpretation_note":"以來源原字標記。"},{"id":"c-jinshu-098-jin033-wangji:line045:m0007","start":7,"end":9,"surface":"劉隗","kind":"person","person_id":"hnd_3at_h4i","status":"contextual_provisional","interpretation_note":"以來源原字標記。"},{"id":"c-jinshu-098-jin033-wangji:line045:m0012","start":12,"end":14,"surface":"杜弘","kind":"person","person_id":"f85_nkp_oek","status":"contextual_provisional","interpretation_note":"以來源原字標記。"},{"id":"c-jinshu-098-jin033-wangji:line045:m0017","start":17,"end":19,"surface":"劉隗","kind":"person","person_id":"hnd_3at_h4i","status":"contextual_provisional","interpretation_note":"以來源原字標記。"},{"id":"c-jinshu-098-jin033-wangji:line045:m0035","start":35,"end":37,"surface":"周劄","kind":"person","person_id":"1a4_h3u_5rc","status":"contextual_provisional","interpretation_note":"以來源原字標記。"},{"id":"c-jinshu-098-jin033-wangji:line045:m0050","start":50,"end":51,"surface":"劄","kind":"person","person_id":"1a4_h3u_5rc","status":"contextual_provisional","interpretation_note":"以來源原字標記。"},{"id":"c-jinshu-098-jin033-wangji:line045:m0054","start":54,"end":55,"surface":"隗","kind":"person","person_id":"hnd_3at_h4i","status":"contextual_